            <div xml:id="d222-a3">

                <pb facs="0329" n="231" sameAs="frus:frus1900/pg231"/>

                <opener><seg rendition="#center">[Inclosure 3.]</seg></opener>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">Decree issued to Prince Ching and Li Hung Chang, and
                        sent by telegraph.</hi></head>
                <p>We have inflicted severe punishment on the ministers of state who have brought
                    about the present calamity, by the issuance of our edict to-day. It will be seen
                    that we have not screened them, but punished them as they deserve. Prince Ching
                    and Li Hung Chang are to at once explain this to the foreign ministers and
                    shortly commence negotiations. If there be any further delay which will hinder
                    this business the said prince and minister will be held responsible.</p>
            </div>
